"76561198034611008", "personaname": "ThurminatorVII", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/thurminator/", "num_games_owned": 701, "num_reviews": 50, "playtime_forever": 489, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 489, "last_played": 1673744899, "avatar": "cfcf1022d6830a7295424800b3590a0d28166d09"}, "language": "english", "review": "If you are a fan of Warhammer 40K or have any passing interest in the franchise, this is an excellent starting point. I knew nothing about Warhammer really until seeing the trailer for Space Marine 2. It looked awesome, which prompted me to start looking into space marines and 40K, and shortly afterwards, this game. It certainly feels and looks like a game from the PS3/360 era, but the gameplay is still very fun and enjoyable to this day. I still only have a surface-level understanding of WH40K, but this game prompted me to start reading the Horus Heresy, watch lore videos online, and get interested in playing Darktide. I can't wait for the sequel to come out later this year.", "timestamp_created": 1673801132, "timestamp_updated": 1673801132, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 7, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.616502046585083008", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "130902323", "author": {"steamid": "76561199076210231", "personaname": "LT905", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199076210231/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 1247, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1247, "last_played": 1673788938, "avatar": "bb99b7973f8770c77df793e68b7754c9e927a455"}, "language": "english", "review": "Most anticipating game of all. Perhaps I am a great fan of Adeptus Astartes. \nCan't wait for the Space marin